Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1288,353.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Crime or Accident?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1289.8,416.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Police Investigation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1312,460.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Goes Nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550,748.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Male Body Found in Kanda River
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the body of an unidentified male was found\Nin the Konda River in Chioda City, Tokyo.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.49,0:01:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(577.8,710)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Battles Without Moe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The remains were badly mutilated,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and police are working to identify\Nthe deceased as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(529.8,468.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This Year's
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(528.4,517.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Lady Omoe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.26,0:01:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's crazy in here. So busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you could help\Naround here as well, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't have enough hands, I\Ncould always hire some new mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're allowed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are raking it in,\Nthanks to the Lady Omoe effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, you should\Nstop talking and get us some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get to have some noobies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oka, Oka, Oka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Okachimachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's such a horrible way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, oh, Okachimachi's been\Noffed on so, oh. How could they?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.70,0:02:26.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,44.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Radio Building
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that doesn't spell radio anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like Rady Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head, it's empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one inside the suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have something on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This note is to notify\Nyou that the Oinky Doink
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cafe is hereby disowned\Nfrom the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, let me see that.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,227)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DISOWNMENT NOTICE
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,302)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Greetings, we trust that you are all doing well.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,378)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This is to notify you that Oinky Doink Café is
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,454)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}hereby disowned from the Creatureland Group.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,529)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink Manager: Yasuko Yaegashi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,605)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink Members: Yume Hiiragi, Shino Ayato,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,680)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Okachimachi, Ranko Mannen, Nagomi Wahira, Zoya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all just a\Nreally bad dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's answering the damn phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Creatureland disowns\Nus, we won't survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when our sales are\Ngrowing, thanks to Lady Omoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to answer everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think for yourself, stupid piglet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't come up with anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really just helpless\Nlittle piggies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this cage we call Akiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're just sitting here waiting\Nfor the day we get slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't plan on dying this young.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(665.6,235.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(622.4,571.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Yumechi has had plastic surgery.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.83,0:03:46.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(662.4,180.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}The pork at Oinky Doink is actually worm meat.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(795,298)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Without a doubt,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(853,374)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ranko is a
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(795,450)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}forty-year-old pig
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still only just 36, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm filled with doubt all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomen. Huh? Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, the cafe still isn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember Akai? Huh? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one who was\Nalways dressed in red, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the body they\Nfound in the Kanda River?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Akai. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police say he may have been tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a maid did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid wouldn't go up\Nout murdering a master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He liked to brag about you\Nwhen we were at other cafes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, the maids there\Nweren't happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was kind of oblivious to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we're scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they might have us\Npegged as oinky-doink regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we can't come home\Nto oinky-doink anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't be fans if we're freakin' dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello masters, welcome home to the pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our cafe has a strict no maids policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Piglet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just regular maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so obvious that you're maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spy some dashing masters\Nsitting right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind if we join.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hey, that's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't fit for drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know some better cafes that\Ndon't serve this kind of slop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's skip this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sorry, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose master do you think\Nyou're harassing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Moe, someone's scary. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey, we have to go\Nnow, actually. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you come home again, my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is what a true\Npigsty should look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Dazzlion was supposed to be the\Nnext lady of Moe at the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the smelly oinkers\Nwho ignored that rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all because I\Nam the next lady in Moe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if it is? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're disowned, you're our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me. Wanna go? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pranko, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 40-year-old maid seems\Nto know what's what. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(787,367)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941,571)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pranko, why did you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting soft on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one to blame for\NOinkidouin getting disowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made an oath of sisterhood with the\Ncurrent head of the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the sister you\Ntold me about before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used to work together a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the 1960s, there was a\Nmaid named Mistress Michio,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was a formidable force in Akiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place where Oinky Doink\NCafe is now used to be a maid
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.35,0:06:57.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1226.8,249.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maid Teahouse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cafe founded by Mistress Michio\Ncalled the Maid Tea House.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head and I worked as maids there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was the one who mentored\Nme and taught me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back when I had very little\Nexperience as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, as close as we were, we regretfully\Nclashed over the cafe's policies.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(981.33,466.67)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}RANKO
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe the head has disowned our\Ncafe due to her contempt for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey pops, I need a reload!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I shall go and\Nsettle this properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all because I stole\Nthe Lady Omoe title. Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this fight is just\Nbetween me and the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't drag you all into\Nit Why in the world would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anybody from our cafe think\Nyou dragged us into this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuka, live out your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't ever forget you, Runko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you all agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're all just\Ngonna be slaughtered pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have what it\Ntakes to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it sucks to admit it. Zoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go, that means we undermine Bronco's\Nresolve to end this with her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, you'll just get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be an early morning for me\Ntomorrow, so I'll take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops, all the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since she met you, girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she actually looked like she was\Nenjoying herself for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, she's desperate\Nabout protecting all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though she doesn't know how to show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell you can't go there without\Nyour star player we can't just abandon you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For going to call\Nourselves mushrooms we need
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get into business\Nlet's show him the power
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a true bond. Now you're\Nchanging your mind you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may lose your lives\Nthough bronco i'm prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm not prepared to die\Njust yet but to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of us come back to\Nthe oinky-doink together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of you then thank you so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I look today?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:10:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skin is glowing in a way that\Nbefits the top of the ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nwho's behind these doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us, furball.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(832,234.67)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Dazzlion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all of you out and leave\Nyour weapons. Ignore them and fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These big heads full of life, you hear\Nme? What are y'all standing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for get the hell out if you're
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(905.33,250.67)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Dazzlion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna kill me then Do it now you're
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all hostage you pathetic porkers\Nshouldn't be picking a fight with the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,king of Beasts my horoscope totally\Nsucked today do you think i'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,die nah we'll be fine female
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intuition yeah let's go with that boss
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(929.33,193.33)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creatureland
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please excuse me the swine have taken\Na hostage and Shot themselves in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:11:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,da's lion kill them but boss you\Npersonally managed as lion kill them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam. Creature
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You yes ma 'am
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so many of them\Nleaving, let's go right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's like a ton of them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you value Simba's life
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they care at all about the hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good old Mistress Snoggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all going to hell\Ntogether, fucking swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them faze you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let them near us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill all of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(929.33,193.33)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creatureland
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think everyone\Nheaded over to Dazzline?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says the CEO is on the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if it isn't Ronk O'Manen...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand over your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's waiting for you upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dream of getting out\Nof here alive if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Miss Nagi. They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we then? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to return these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I took the Lady Boon title.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truthfully, I thought I could\Nnever have won it that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ranko, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ask you to reconsider\Ndisowning Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means you're not here to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I realize now that I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If at all possible, I would\Nrather not kill you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uzuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ranko, I can get you a seat\Nwith the higher-ups. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long as you can prove your sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must go kill the lazy\Nswine at Oinky Doon. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:14:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're deeply desperate\Nto protect the pigsty,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just because you can't get over\Nwhat happened to Miss Michio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, you must\Nfight to protect me, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Miss Michio would understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Working under me will get you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Security in Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Respect from the other maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masters with wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll provide you with all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can be in the maid\Nbusiness together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, Oinky Doink\NCafe means the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to give my life in exchange\Nfor letting Oinky Doink off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Runko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised we would go home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find this hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uzuko, Akiba is going to\Nneed a cafe like Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cafe that can't even\Nsqueeze out their dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think an indignant person like you would
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,truly benefit by visiting the Oinky Doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful with your\Nchoice of words. Franco!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so special about that pigsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I enjoy it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all went to the casino together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and played a baseball game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They threw a party on my birthday and\Neveryone sang and celebrated it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've gotten much better\Nat catch-up doodling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those crab pincers on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave Nogomi out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I will gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi, you can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, please let me do my share.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(866.33,185)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Dazzlion
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop the bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it, piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to watch\Nyou all get slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you on the other side, my babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I was a part\Nof Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A manager can't give up that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko and Nogomi are out there fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't Oinky Doon your cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna mess with my damn cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to lock off one of my pigtails.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ranko,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the pigsty special to you because this\Nmaid here somehow got under your skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what does she have to offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She reminds me of Miss Michio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power is everything in Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid with no power\Nhas no worth to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uzuko, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we kept listening to Miss Michio,\Nwe would have been massacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you've lived\Nyour life killing maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me or her. Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Ronko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't she a one and only sworn sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ronko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot me, or else she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both too precious and dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like family I never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ussuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let them off in\Nexchange for my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:17:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikidoin Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my only home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are, an old warthog,\Non your knees crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're worth shedding tears over? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to squeeze out at least ten\Ntimes more of the honey money from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the oinky-doink is not disowned,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll let us pay off our dues\Nif we pay ten times more honey money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to die? No! I'm sorry!\NWe will! We'll squeeze it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Usuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, you're nothing but livestock\Nworking your asses off for the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometime, come see my work as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boinky Doink Cafe is epic to\Nserve as a home to all masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I would ever go to a pigsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a message from our heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's unarmed, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said shoot her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighting is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a damn hole in my pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, the fighting is over. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't nobody shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:19:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hair tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that it got ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can just buy another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.23,0:20:11.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(562.67,252.01)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi everyone, you're all\Nalive. We were so totally
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,close to dying so what happened she let us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off as long as we pay 10 times more honey
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money for real how are\Nwe gonna do that we never
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even paid our regular\Ndues on time couldn't you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have haggled for less\Nno way that whole ordeal
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was terrifying. You\Nshould be grateful. I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work really hard everyone\NI want to welcome you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,home to the pigsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's cute, but I think this\None would look good on her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to take that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, could you please wrap it as a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this one might look cute
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ambulance, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call an ambulance, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be a cute maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your breath, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cute little maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're already a wonderful maid, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid I really look up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to keep doing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco...
